# The build context is tarred and uploaded to the Docker daemon, which in the
# reference environment lives in a VirtualBox VM across a TLS connection — so
# context size costs time on every single build. target/ alone is ~23 MB of it.
# See docs/architecture.md#docker-machine--virtualbox-on-windows
target/

# The image builds with the Maven image, not the wrapper — see the Dockerfile.
.mvn/
mvnw
mvnw.cmd

# Not used by the image build.
postman/
README.md
.gitignore

# Editors / IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
